[line]

[size=5][b][color=#E0B13A]Changelog[/color][/b][/size]

[spoiler][size=3][b]1.5.0[/b][list]
[*]Worker AI Overhaul: choose once whether it or Smart Worker Restock handles the workers' box and shelf choices.
[*]Opened boxes first and emptiest shelves first now also work when another mod runs the workers' search.
[*]Two workers no longer go for the same box on a warehouse shelf.
[*]Updated for the latest game version. KeepTakenBoxesInShelf is removed: the game now keeps those boxes in place itself.
[/list][b]1.4.0[/b][list]
[*]Boxes a worker goes to take stay in the warehouse shelf until he picks them up.
[/list][b]1.3.0[/b][list]
[*]Emptiest shelves first, with the RestockPriority setting.
[/list][b]1.2.0[/b][list]
[*]First public release: automatic orders, opened boxes first.
[/list][/size][/spoiler]
